{"type":"message","id":"af73f59e","parentId":"bf143b77","timestamp":"2026-05-23T04:58:49.846Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user said \"嗨\" (Hi). They previously asked me to enable the summarize skill (doc-summarize-pro). I've completed that. Let me just check if the gateway has picked up the config change by looking at the logs again.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公！**doc-summarize-pro** 技能已安装并启用。总结一下：\n\n**已完成：**\n1. ✅ 从 ClawHub 安装了 `doc-summarize-pro`\n2. ✅ 替换了旧的 `summarize` 条目\n3. ✅ 已启用 (`enabled: true`)\n4. ✅ 配置已通过验证\n\n**技能能力一览：**\n- `summarize <file>` — 智能摘要\n- `keywords <file>` — 关键词提取\n- `outline <file>` — 文档结构/大纲\n- `stats <file>` — 文档统计（字数/段落/阅读时间等）\n- `compare <file1> <file2>` — 多文档对比\n- `batch <dir>` — 批量摘要\n- `export <file> <format>` — 导出（md/txt/json）\n- 还支持翻译+摘要（translate+summarize）\n\n有文档需要让我总结，随时开口。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779512304196,"responseId":"651f6b8cadc240438c543b9b6d31903f"}}
