{"type":"message","id":"f80dcdfa","parentId":"b071b4f7","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:03:46.597Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_f7f19e90513247c99ef40bb7","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenClaw 2026.5.19 (unknown) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.\n\nUsage: openclaw gateway call [options] <method>\n\nCall a Gateway method\n\nArguments:\n  method                 Method name (health/status/system-presence/cron.*)\n\nOptions:\n  --expect-final         Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output JSON (default: false)\n  --params <json>        JSON object string for params (default: \"{}\")\n  --password ***  Gateway password (password auth)\n  --timeout <ms>         Timeout in ms (default: \"10000\")\n  --token ***        Gateway token (if required)\n  --url <url>            Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to gateway.remote.url\n                         when configured)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":2089,"aggregated":"OpenClaw 2026.5.19 (unknown) — All your chats, one OpenClaw.\n\nUsage: openclaw gateway call [options] <method>\n\nCall a Gateway method\n\nArguments:\n  method                 Method name (health/status/system-presence/cron.*)\n\nOptions:\n  --expect-final         Wait for final response (agent) (default: false)\n  -h, --help             Display help for command\n  --json                 Output JSON (default: false)\n  --params <json>        JSON object string for params (default: \"{}\")\n  --password ***  Gateway password (password auth)\n  --timeout <ms>         Timeout in ms (default: \"10000\")\n  --token ***        Gateway token (if required)\n  --url <url>            Gateway WebSocket URL (defaults to gateway.remote.url\n                         when configured)","cwd":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-wxlee"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1779512626586}}
