{"type":"message","id":"f964c727","parentId":"9cfa3e3e","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:05:53.273Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The skill says the tool is `feishu_doc`. But I need to figure out how to call it from my current toolset. Let me check what tools I have available - I don't see a `feishu_doc` tool in my tool list. The skill describes it as a Feishu plugin tool. Let me try using the feishu-doc skill to call it. But wait - the skill's tool `feishu_doc` is described as a tool that's available via the feishu channel's tool system.\n\nLooking at my tool list, I don't see `feishu_doc` as a direct tool. Let me try calling it through the gateway or just use the skill directly as described.\n\nActually, looking at the available skills, there's a `feishu-doc` skill. The SKILL.md describes the tool `feishu_doc` with various actions. Since this is a Feishu plugin tool, I should be able to invoke it. Let me check how to call tools from this context.\n\nI don't have a direct `feishu_doc` tool in my available tools list. Let me think about this differently - the feishu-doc skill says it's a tool that's part of the feishu channel. Let me see if I can use the `sessions_send` or some other approach.\n\nActually, looking more carefully at the skill - it describes the tool but I think it's a system tool provided by the feishu plugin, not something I can call from my tool list. But the skill says \"Activate when user mentions Feishu docs, cloud docs, or docx links.\"\n\nLet me try using the `tools.execute` gateway call method to invoke the feishu_doc tool.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aecfbbbe62de40dfbf04b165","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try invoking feishu_doc create through the gateway\nopenclaw gateway call tools.execute --params '{\"tool\":\"feishu_doc\",\"params\":{\"action\":\"create\",\"title\":\"doc-summarize-pro 技能测试 - 2026-05-23\",\"owner_open_id\":\"ou_9e18438fb941decf11a0b