{"type":"message","id":"6a485229","parentId":"20706d49","timestamp":"2026-05-23T05:09:46.347Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The feishu_doc tool should be available as a plugin tool that agents can call via the feishu plugin. Since I'm in a Feishu chat, I can use the feishu_doc tool directly as a system-provided tool. Let me check how tools are exposed. In the available skills, there's a `feishu-doc` skill at `~/.openclaw/plugin-skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md`. This is a plugin skill, not a tool I can call directly from the command line.\n\nThe feishu_doc action is available as a tool in the OpenClaw system. Let me just try using it directly since I'm in the Feishu chat context - the tool should be available to me as an agent.\n\nActually, looking at the available tools listed at the top, I don't see a feishu_doc tool listed. These are plugin-provided tools. Let me check if the feishu-doc skill is a regular skill.\n\nWait, the path is `~/.openclaw/plugin-skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md`. The `plugin-skills` directory suggests it's a skill that wraps the feishu plugin's tool capability. \n\nSince I'm in the Feishu conversation and the feishu channel has `tools.doc: true`, the feishu_doc tool should be available to me. Let me just call it directly.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"文档工具已就绪，我来创建一份测试文档，用 summarize "},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_efa88e6d6d00438695aabaaf","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat > /tmp/doc-summarize-test.md << 'EOF'\n# doc-summarize-pro 能力概述\n\n## 核心功能列表\n\ndoc-summarize-pro 是一个纯 Bash 实现的高效文档分析工具集，无需任何外部依赖。\n\n### 命令一览\n\n1. summarize - 智能文档摘要\n2. keywords  - 关键词提取\n3. outline   - 文档结构抽取\n4. stats     - 文档统计信息\n5. compare   - 双文档对比\n6. batch     - 目录批量处理\n7. export    - 导出为 md/txt/json\n8. history   - 处理历史记录\n9. config    - 配置管理\n\n### 技术特点\n\n- 纯 Bash 实现，零外部依赖\n- 支持多种文本格式（.txt .md .rst .log）\n- 智能断句：支持英文句号、中文句号、感叹号、问号\n- 停用词过滤：中英文通用停用词表\n- 可配置：摘要句子数和关键词数量\n\n### 使用场景\n\n- 快速阅读长文档\n- 文献/论文要点提取\n- 文档对比分析\n- 批量处理日志文件\nEOF\n\n# Test with summarize\nsummarize /tmp/doc-summarize-test.md 2>&1","timeout":10},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"cat > /tmp/doc-summarize-test.md << 'EOF'\\n# doc-summarize-pro 能力概述\\n\\n## 核心功能列表\\n\\ndoc-summarize-pro 是一个纯 Bash 实现的高效文档分析工具集，无需任何外部依赖。\\n\\n### 命令一览\\n\\n1. summarize - 智能文档摘要\\n2. keywords  - 关键词提取\\n3. outline   - 文档结构抽取\\n4. stats     - 文档统计信息\\n5. compare   - 双文档对比\\n6. batch     - 目录批量处理\\n7. export    - 导出为 md/txt/json\\n8. history   - 处理历史记录\\n9. config    - 配置管理\\n\\n### 技术特点\\n\\n- 纯 Bash 实现，零外部依赖\\n- 支持多种文本格式（.txt .md .rst .log）\\n- 智能断句：支持英文句号、中文句号、感叹号、问号\\n- 停用词过滤：中英文通用停用词表\\n- 可配置：摘要句子数和关键词数量\\n\\n### 使用场景\\n\\n- 快速阅读长文档\\n- 文献/论文要点提取\\n- 文档对比分析\\n- 批量处理日志文件\\nEOF\\n\\n# Test with summarize\\nsummarize /tmp/doc-summarize-test.md 2>&1\", \"timeout\": 10}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779512922265,"responseId":"47e83a8ff7594eea96d0ff659524bdcd"}}
