{"type":"message","id":"77634073","parentId":"a8e8ed87","timestamp":"2026-05-23T07:35:10.408Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is sending \"hi\" again. They previously asked me to test creating a Feishu cloud document. I was in the middle of figuring out how to invoke the feishu_doc tool. Let me try using the tool directly now.\n\nLooking at the SKILL.md, the feishu_doc is a tool that's available when the feishu channel is configured with `tools.doc: true`. Since this is a direct conversation on Feishu, the tool should be available to me as a tool I can call.\n\nBut wait - tools in OpenClaw are typically invoked by the framework, not directly by the agent. The SKILL.md says the tool is `feishu_doc` with action parameter. Let me just try calling it as a tool.\n\nActually, looking more carefully, the SKILL.md describes it as a tool that the agent can use. Since the feishu channel has `tools.doc: true`, and I'm in a feishu conversation, I should be able to use the feishu_doc tool.\n\nBut looking at the available tools I have, I don't see a `feishu_doc` tool in my tool list. The tools I have are: read, write, edit, exec, process, web_search, web_fetch, image, image_generate, music_generate, video_generate, memory_get, memory_search, sessions_*, subagents, update_plan, session_status.\n\nSo feishu_doc is not directly available as an agent tool. It's something the runtime can call. Let me check if there's another way.\n\nActually, looking at the SKILL.md description: \"Single tool `feishu_doc` with action parameter for all document operations\". This means it's a tool registered by the channel/plugin, and when I'm in a feishu conversation context, the runtime provides it. Let me see if I can just call it.\n\nWait - the SKILL.md file is in `plugin-skills/feishu-doc/SKILL.md`. This is a skill file that describes how to use the feishu_doc tool. But the tool itself is registered by the feishu channel plugin.\n\nLet me look at how other tools work. The SKILL.md says:\n\n```json\n{ \"action\": \"create\", \"title\": \"New Document\", \"owner_open_id\": \"ou_xxx\" }\n```\n\nThis suggests it's a tool I can invoke programmatically. But in my available tools list, I don't see it directly.\n\nHmm, maybe I need to use the `sessions_send` or some other mechanism. Or perhaps in this runtime context (the feishu channel) the tool is available but not listed in my tools. Let me just try to use it as if it were a tool.\n\nActually, looking at the original SKILL.md more carefully - it says \"feishu-doc\" is a plugin skill. The feishu channel plugin registers the `feishu_doc` tool. In the OpenClaw runtime, when an agent is in a feishu conversation, the agent can use these tools.\n\nSince I don't have an explicit `feishu_doc` function in my tool list, maybe the way to use it is differently. Let me look at how the skill says to use it...\n\nFrom the SKILL.md, it seems like the tool `feishu_doc` should be directly callable. But I don't have it as a tool. Let me try via exec with the gateway.\n\nActually, let me re-read the SKILL.md description more carefully. It says \"Single tool `feishu_doc` with action parameter\". In OpenClaw, channel-provided tools get registered and the agent can call them. Let me just try calling it.\n\nHmm, but I literally don't have a `feishu_doc` tool in my available tools. So maybe I need to use the gateway call approach, or perhaps there's a way the agent can discover and use these tools.\n\nLet me look at this differently. The SKILL.md is in `plugin-skills/feishu-doc/`. These are like reference docs for plugins. The tool itself is registered by the feishu channel plugin. Since I'm currently in a feishu conversation, the tool should be available for me to use.\n\nBut I don't see it in my tool list. Perhaps it's accessible through the OpenClaw runtime in a different way - maybe through exec or another mechanism.\n\nLet me try a different approach. I'll use exec to call the gateway and invoke the tool through the feishu channel's tool system.\n\nActually wait, I recall from the health check output that `tools.doc: true` is set for the feishu channel. And looking at the available skills, there's `feishu-doc` listed as a plugin-skill. \n\nLet me just try creating the doc via the API directly since I already have the credentials and know it works (I already created a doc successfully earlier - it just had issues with permission granting).\n\nLet me try the full flow again, this time also trying to write content to the document.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"主公，我来"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_04cd4011337945d5b00b7847","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 << 'PYEOF'\nimport json, urllib.request, urllib.error\n\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f:\n    cfg = json.load(f)\n\n# Use xiaoye account (this channel's bot)\nxiaoye = cfg['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['xiaoye']\napp_id = xiaoye['appId']\napp_secret = xiaoye['appSecret']\n\ndef api_post(url, data, token=***\n    req = urllib.request.Request(url, method='POST', data=json.dumps(data).encode())\n    req.add_header('Content-Type', 'application/json')\n    if token:\n        req.add_header('Authorization', f'Bearer {token}')\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req) as resp:\n        return json.loads(resp.read())\n\n# 1. Get token\ntoken_data = api_post(\n    'https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\n    {'app_id': app_id, 'app_secret': app_secret}\n)\ntoken = token_data['tenant_access_token']\nprint(f\"✅ Token 获取成功\")\n\n# 2. Create document\ndoc_data = api_post(\n    'https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/docx/v1/documents',\n    {'title': 'doc-summarize-pro 技能测试报告 - 2026-05-23'},\n    token\n)\ndoc_id = doc_data['data']['document']['document_id']\nprint(f\"✅ 文档创建成功\")\nprint(f\"   文档ID: {doc_id}\")\n\n# 3. Write content to document (insert blocks)\ncontent_data = api_post(\n    f'https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_id}/blocks/{doc_id}/children',\n    token,\n    {\n        \"children\": [\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 3,\n                \"heading1\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"测试报告\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 2,\n                \"text\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"测试时间：2026-05-23\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 2,\n                \"text\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"测试了 doc-summarize-pro v3.0.0 的全部核心命令。\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 4,\n                \"heading2\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"测试结果\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 12,\n                \"bullet\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"summarize — 智能摘要，通过\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 12,\n                \"bullet\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"keywords — 关键词提取，通过\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 12,\n                \"bullet\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"outline — 文档结构，通过\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 12,\n                \"bullet\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"stats — 文档统计，通过\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 12,\n                \"bullet\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"compare — 双文档对比，通过\"}}]\n                }\n            },\n            {\n                \"block_type\": 12,\n                \"bullet\": {\n                    \"elements\": [{\"text_run\": {\"content\": \"export — 导出JSON/MD/TXT，通过\"}}]\n                }\n            }\n        ]\n    }\n)\n\nif content_data.get('code') == 0:\n    print(f\"✅ 文档内容写入成功\")\nelse:\n    print(f\"⚠️ 写入内容: {content_data}\")\n\n# 4. Grant permission (try both openid and user_id)\nprint(f\"\\n📎 文档链接: https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docx/{doc_id}\")\nPYEOF","timeout":20},"partialArgs":"{\"command\": \"python3 << 'PYEOF'\\nimport json, urllib.request, urllib.error\\n\\nwith open('/home/node/.openclaw/openclaw.json') as f:\\n    cfg = json.load(f)\\n\\n# Use xiaoye account (this channel's bot)\\nxiaoye = cfg['channels']['feishu']['accounts']['xiaoye']\\napp_id = xiaoye['appId']\\napp_secret = xiaoye['appSecret']\\n\\ndef api_post(url, data, token=***    req = urllib.request.Request(url, method='POST', data=json.dumps(data).encode())\\n    req.add_header('Content-Type', 'application/json')\\n    if token:\\n        req.add_header('Authorization', f'Bearer {token}')\\n    with urllib.request.urlopen(req) as resp:\\n        return json.loads(resp.read())\\n\\n# 1. Get token\\ntoken_data = api_post(\\n    'https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/auth/v3/tenant_access_token/internal',\\n    {'app_id': app_id, 'app_secret': app_secret}\\n)\\ntoken = token_data['tenant_access_token']\\nprint(f\\\"✅ Token 获取成功\\\")\\n\\n# 2. Create document\\ndoc_data = api_post(\\n    'https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/docx/v1/documents',\\n    {'title': 'doc-summarize-pro 技能测试报告 - 2026-05-23'},\\n    token\\n)\\ndoc_id = doc_data['data']['document']['document_id']\\nprint(f\\\"✅ 文档创建成功\\\")\\nprint(f\\\"   文档ID: {doc_id}\\\")\\n\\n# 3. Write content to document (insert blocks)\\ncontent_data = api_post(\\n    f'https://open.larksuite.com/open-apis/docx/v1/documents/{doc_id}/blocks/{doc_id}/children',\\n    token,\\n    {\\n        \\\"children\\\": [\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 3,\\n                \\\"heading1\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"测试报告\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 2,\\n                \\\"text\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"测试时间：2026-05-23\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 2,\\n                \\\"text\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"测试了 doc-summarize-pro v3.0.0 的全部核心命令。\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 4,\\n                \\\"heading2\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"测试结果\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 12,\\n                \\\"bullet\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"summarize — 智能摘要，通过\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 12,\\n                \\\"bullet\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"keywords — 关键词提取，通过\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 12,\\n                \\\"bullet\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"outline — 文档结构，通过\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 12,\\n                \\\"bullet\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"stats — 文档统计，通过\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 12,\\n                \\\"bullet\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"compare — 双文档对比，通过\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            },\\n            {\\n                \\\"block_type\\\": 12,\\n                \\\"bullet\\\": {\\n                    \\\"elements\\\": [{\\\"text_run\\\": {\\\"content\\\": \\\"export — 导出JSON/MD/TXT，通过\\\"}}]\\n                }\\n            }\\n        ]\\n    }\\n)\\n\\nif content_data.get('code') == 0:\\n    print(f\\\"✅ 文档内容写入成功\\\")\\nelse:\\n    print(f\\\"⚠️ 写入内容: {content_data}\\\")\\n\\n# 4. Grant permission (try both openid and user_id)\\nprint(f\\\"\\\\n📎 文档链接: https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docx/{doc_id}\\\")\\nPYEOF\", \"timeout\": 20}"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779521610219,"responseId":"044b149d2f2145aaad294f2489572e54"}}
