{"type":"message","id":"d345cd2c","parentId":"030eccbe","timestamp":"2026-05-23T07:37:07.168Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good progress! The document was created and content was written successfully. The permission grant failed because the xiaoye bot app doesn't have the `drive:drive` scope. \n\nBut the document is created and content is written. The doc URL is: https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docx/X4x1dZexVowhN4xuewqjoXy8ppg\n\nThe issue is that since the bot can't grant permissions, only the bot can see the document. I need a way to share it.\n\nActually, looking at the feishu_doc SKILL.md again, it says:\n\"Always pass owner_open_id with the requesting user's open_id so the user automatically gets full_access permission on the created document.\"\n\nSo the feishu_doc tool handles the permission grant automatically. But since I'm going directly through the API, I can't do that.\n\nLet me tell the user the document was created successfully but there's a permissions issue because the bot needs additional scopes.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"文档创建成功并写入了内容！不过权限授予需要 bot 申请 `drive:drive` 等 scope。\n\n这是最终结果：\n\n**文档已创建：** https://bytedance.feishu.cn/docx/X4x1dZexVowhN4xuewqjoXy8ppg\n\n**写入的内容：**\n- 标题：doc-summarize-pro 技能测试报告\n- 正文：测试时间、测试内容概述\n- 二级标题：测试结果\n- 6 条测试项目（summarize/keywords/outline/stats/compare/export — 全部标为通过）\n\n**已知问题：** xiaoye 这个 bot 应用的权限不够，无法自动授予你对文档的访问权限。需要到飞书开放平台为 bot 添加 `drive:drive` 相关权限。你现在能访问这个链接吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"deepseek-ai/deepseek-v4-flash","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779521796115,"responseId":"c988a816d48d4edfa3fb5dcbb4b5a040"}}
